L4-E7 / P0-7: THE SOLAR STAGE'S D-10 AND D-16 BY CIRCUIT ALTERNATIVES (MESHSAT-1357, 5 October 2026)
Prototype design, desk arithmetic: nothing is bought, built, powered or measured; no generator, registry or page of the tree is
edited (apply_gen_sch_e_p0sol.py is a draft, composed here on scratch copies only). Bases: PRINTED LIMIT, TYPICAL, MEASURED (none
exists), ASSUMPTION, MODELED, INFERRED, SESSION, NETLIST, CATALOGUE. The lead-inductance method is ended: no loop is searched and
none is claimed to pass; the record's transient model runs only at its reference loop and the envelope's ends, on the changed
circuit, against the same failure case.

